OL,3,GNEWSASuspected Hamas member guilty of
OL,4,AUK knife attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspected Hamas member, wanted in
OL,7,FGermany over an alleged plot to murder
OL,8,FJewish people, has been found guilty of
OL,9,Fa knife attack on a bailiff outside his
OL,10,FUK home.
OL,12,FGermany-born Mohammed Alfatih, also
OL,13,Fknown as Mohammed Naim, is reported to
OL,14,Fhave acted as a bodyguard to the leader
OL,15,Fof Hamas before being granted asylum in
OL,16,Fthe UK in 2015 and British citizenship
OL,17,Fin 2020.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
