OL,3,GNEWSASuspected Hamas member guilty of
OL,4,AUK knife attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 40-year-old was found guilty by
OL,7,Fmajority verdict of unlawful wounding,
OL,8,Fpossession of two knives and criminal
OL,9,Fdamage. He was cleared of the more
OL,10,Fserious charge of wounding with intent.
OL,12,FThe incident involving the bailiff
OL,13,Fhappened in Birmingham last year, while
OL,14,FAlfatih was under surveillance by a
OL,15,Fcounter-terrorism unit.
